# The agent surface, for whoever unpacks the tarball. `pip install` does not deliver it:
# packages.find is `include = ["jnwb*"]`, so an install of this sdist writes jnwb/ into
# site-packages and discards skills/ and AGENTS.md -- verified by installing the built
# sdist into a clean environment, which yields jnwb/ and nothing else. The skill files'
# links to docs/ dangle here too, because docs/ is not in the sdist: 11 of their 12
# repository-relative links do not resolve inside the tarball.
#
# That is the intended outcome, not an oversight. A skill is read by a harness pointed at
# a directory, nothing in jnwb/ reads one (`grep -rn skills jnwb/ --include=*.py` is
# empty), and copying the tree under jnwb/ to force it into the wheel would create the
# second skill tree that harness gate 2 forbids. An installed copy finds them through
# `jnwb.SKILLS_URL` instead.
graft skills
include AGENTS.md

prune tests
prune scripts
prune artifacts
prune omission
prune site
prune _build
global-exclude *.pyc
global-exclude __pycache__
